webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n试试看！\n\n<br>\n\n\n不过……\n基本上每个看起来都不违和（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这个应用\n可以实时变化\n合成的方式也恰到好处\n真是太棒了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n        而且！\n    \n即使是为了让画面看起来特别自然\n这个点数之多也让我吃了一惊！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3622521/002-28eda1cf0f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3622521/002-28eda1cf0f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"743\" height=\"470\"></a></figure>\n\n设置起来很费劲（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n开发中的\n数据制作也是一样\n想要提高质量的话\n有时就会变成庞大的数据量\n也需要非常细致的作业！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3622521/003-bc08ba6e1a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3622521/003-bc08ba6e1a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"354\" height=\"320\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n            总之……认真设置了一番（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n结果！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n            增田和琪琪……\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3622521/004-7898ef38a5.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3622521/004-7898ef38a5.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"638\"></a></figure>\n\n哎呀呀……真是遗憾的结果……\n有点像虎面人（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n最后……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3622521/005-216b0efdcb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3622521/005-216b0efdcb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"636\" height=\"850\"></a></figure>\n\n\n不知道哪个才是真的了\n所以把原图贴在这里（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（附赠）\n我想很多人都知道\n这个应用叫作\n\"Face swap live\"！\n\n<br>\n\n\n搜索“实时换脸”的话\n会出来各种各样的应用，大家可以试试看！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3622521/006-6a1eadb643.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3622521/006-6a1eadb643.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"495\" height=\"740\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这不是广告哦！（笑）</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">日曜日の午後</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">効果音作りに飽きてきたので</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">いまさらながら・・・</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3622521/001-a68f6d4478.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3622521/001-a68f6d4478.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nやってみた！\n\n<br>\n\n\nけど・・・\n比較的どれも違和感ない（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこのアプリ\nリアルタイム変化が出来るのと\n合成の仕方が絶妙で\n素晴らしいです！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n        そして！\n    \n特に違和感ないようにするためとは言え\nこのポイント量の多さには驚いた！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3622521/002-28eda1cf0f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3622521/002-28eda1cf0f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"743\" height=\"470\"></a></figure>\n\n設定するのは大変（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n開発での\nデータ作成と同じで\nクオリティを高めようとすると\n莫大なデータ量になったり\n丁寧な作業が必要になります！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3622521/003-bc08ba6e1a.webp\" t